; Controls. Display-only: the gun is aimed and fired from the VR controller (or
; the keyboard on desktop), so these show what the hand is doing rather than
; being poked themselves — ray_gun.gd animates them off the same button read it
; sends to the core. The trigger swings on TriggerPivot, a pin under the barrel
; at the front of the grip; the rest press into the barrel's top face (y 0.045).
